    "explanation": "All 22 exceptions are explained by exactly two source semantics, and none is unresolved. (1) Twelve stations have Status Code = P (planned): they carry no charging-unit records and no station-level EVSE totals, because nothing is built yet. Domain rule G2 already excludes them from operational supply. (2) Ten stations contain units whose charging_level is 'legacy'. Legacy units are not counted in the L1/L2/DCFC aggregate, so the unit-row count exceeds the reported total by exactly the legacy count; two of those ten hold ONLY legacy units and so report no aggregate at all. 12 + 10 = 22.",
